WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.247
After you order, this is how your social
media automation gets set up.

2
00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:13.825
After you order, we start with your brand:
what you sell, who you talk to, and what you
want to post. We adapt the system to fit
your voice.

3
00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:23.123
You connect your accounts through a secure
OAuth connection. You sign in on the
platform's own page and approve access. We
never see your password.

4
00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:31.214
If an account is new, we handle the initial
warm-up period before automation starts.
This helps new accounts get going in a
natural way.

5
00:00:32.014 --> 00:00:40.745
Together we plan a posting calendar. For
each post you pick the day, the time, and
the platform: TikTok, Instagram or YouTube.

6
00:00:41.545 --> 00:00:48.557
Before anything is published, the post is
reviewed and approved. The text and the
video are checked, so nothing goes live
unchecked.

7
00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:56.277
Approved posts go out on your calendar.
Every post is logged, so you can see what
was published, and where, and when.

8
00:00:57.077 --> 00:01:02.232
Done. Need help? Email
support@ironvisiontools.com.
